  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "forget 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握 forget doing 和 forget to do 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "forget doing"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 表示忘记做过的某事（已做）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "forget to do"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 表示忘记去做某件事（没做）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：I’ll never "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "forget meeting"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " my school headmaster for the first time. 我永远忘不了和我小学校长初次见面的情景。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The light in the office is still on. I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "forgot to turn"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " it off. 办公室的灯还亮着，我忘记关了。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
